{"unit_id":"LilycleHeart__dsh-liuli-ui-enhance#feature-wallpaper-theme","repo":"LilycleHeart/dsh-liuli-ui-enhance","commit":"36068f437b60dc3a008f323708063f03f031135d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/liuli-runtime.ts:219-220","src/client/liuli-runtime.ts:397-451"],"text":"琉璃 的功能「壁纸动态取色」：上传壁纸后可从图像提取源色，并据此生成 M3 亮色或暗色调色板。主题设置启用动态取色且背景使用图像时，运行时会重新计算配色并应用到界面。"}
{"unit_id":"LilycleHeart__dsh-liuli-ui-enhance#feature-wallpaper-material","repo":"LilycleHeart/dsh-liuli-ui-enhance","commit":"36068f437b60dc3a008f323708063f03f031135d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/liuli-runtime.ts:61-90","src/client/liuli-runtime.ts:319-320","src/client/LiuliAppearance.tsx:1-17"],"text":"琉璃 的功能「壁纸与材质设置」：用户可在外观设置中上传或移除壁纸，并调整背景适配、选区、翻转和旋转。插件保存壁纸并把背景与亚克力模糊等样式应用到界面。"}
{"unit_id":"LilycleHeart__dsh-liuli-ui-enhance#feature-settings","repo":"LilycleHeart/dsh-liuli-ui-enhance","commit":"36068f437b60dc3a008f323708063f03f031135d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:1921-1925","src/client/LiuliAppearance.tsx:1-17","src/liuli-settings.ts:1-18"],"text":"琉璃 的功能「界面外观控制」：通过 DSH 设置页的外观分区配置品牌色、背景、字体、圆角、泛光、阴影和面板留白；设置写入插件的界面配置并用于更新主题。"}
{"unit_id":"LilycleHeart__dsh-liuli-ui-enhance#feature-voiceprint","repo":"LilycleHeart/dsh-liuli-ui-enhance","commit":"36068f437b60dc3a008f323708063f03f031135d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/HeaderEffects.tsx:1-18","src/host-audio.ts:1-20"],"text":"琉璃 的功能「会话声纹」：会话页头插入声纹画布与系统音频监听按钮，波形依据音频频段和用户设置绘制。用户可在功能设置中调整声纹响应参数；桌面捕获能力由宿主端音频模块提供。"}
{"unit_id":"LilycleHeart__dsh-liuli-ui-enhance#feature-dock","repo":"LilycleHeart/dsh-liuli-ui-enhance","commit":"36068f437b60dc3a008f323708063f03f031135d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/dock-shell.ts:1-9","src/client/index.ts:1-16"],"text":"琉璃 的功能「可停靠工作区」：在支持的布局中把侧栏、会话、页头和详情等面板组成可调整的停靠布局。布局状态会自动保存，也支持命名槽位以及导入、导出布局。"}
{"unit_id":"LilycleHeart__dsh-liuli-ui-enhance#feature-browser","repo":"LilycleHeart/dsh-liuli-ui-enhance","commit":"36068f437b60dc3a008f323708063f03f031135d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/browser-webview.ts:1-20"],"text":"琉璃 的功能「侧栏浏览器」：在侧栏中打开网页标签，并通过宿主浏览器引擎同步标签状态、导航操作和窗口几何信息。若没有原生 webview 能力，客户端能力探测会返回空值供浏览器面板回退到 iframe。"}
